!Name: var200
!C Period 200+5N 2c/5 rake
!C Paul Tooke, September 2003 including reactions by David Bell and Jason Summers
!C with improved LWSS creation reaction suggested by David Bell
!C This rake is period 200, to increase the period by 5N:
